{"name":"Very Berry","hex":"#bb3381","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"very","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adverb","definitions":["To a great extent or degree.","Conforming to fact, reality or rule; true."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["True, real, actual.","The same; identical."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/very"},{"term":"berry","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A small succulent fruit, of any one of many varieties.","A soft fruit which develops from a single ovary and contains seeds not encased in pits."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To pick berries.","To bear or produce berries."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/berry"}],"entries":[{"title":"Starburst (candy)","blocks":[{"text":"Starburst is the brand name of a box-shaped, fruit-flavoured soft taffy manufactured by the Wrigley Company, which is a subsidiary of Mars, Inc. Starburst has many different varieties, such as Tropical, Sour, FaveREDs, Watermelon, Very Berry, Superfruit, Summer Blast and Original."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ac/Starburst-Candies.jpg/330px-Starburst-Candies.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Starburst_(candy)"},{"title":"Airborne (dietary supplement)","blocks":[{"text":"Airborne is an American brand of dietary supplement containing herbal extracts, amino acids, antioxidants, electrolytes, vitamins, and other ingredients originally marketed as preventing the common cold and improving immune function."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4b/Airborne-logo.png/330px-Airborne-logo.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Airborne_(dietary_supplement)"},{"title":"Very Berry (EP)","blocks":[{"text":"Very Berry is the EP by South Korean girl group Berry Good. The album contains seven tracks and is led by title track \"Angel\". It was released on April 20, 2016, as result of the crowdfunding campaign launched on March 11 on Makestar. The ₩10 million goal was reached in ten days."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/a/a2/VeryBerrycover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Very_Berry_(EP)"},{"title":"Berry","blocks":[{"text":"A berry is a small, pulpy, and often edible fruit. Typically, berries are juicy, rounded, brightly colored, sweet, sour or tart, and do not have a stone or pit although many pips or seeds may be present.‍ Common examples of berries in the culinary sense are strawberries, raspberries, blueberries, blackberries, white currants, blackcurrants, and redcurrants.‍ In Britain, soft fruit is a horticultural term for such fruits.‍"}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e4/Berberis_thunbergii_berries.jpg/330px-Berberis_thunbergii_berries.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Berry"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/87/Starburst_candy.jpg/500px-Starburst_candy.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/87/Starburst_candy.jpg/1280px-Starburst_candy.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/87/Starburst_candy.jpg/500px-Starburst_candy.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"in-package Starburst Flavors","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AStarburst_candy.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e1/Opalfruits.jpg/500px-Opalfruits.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e1/Opalfruit